="width:100%"><p>Are ear seeds safe to use every day?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c9b7c9a4-11f5-4bfd-95f7-5fa1ee79c54e" class="r-195v1wj" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-n4adoa" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rarb2:"><div data-rid="9280a108-d343-4569-be3f-4e33e31b9043" class="r-3ikbdl"><div data-rid="432044b4-f02c-438e-a895-60805b52d76f" class="r-v37ex9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Ear seeds are a gentle, non-invasive way to support your body’s natural balance. They can be worn daily for 3–5 days at a time without causing harm or irritation.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1fc3eb7c-53fb-4541-a878-aa83f14636f1" class="r-1l5yxz4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e98d85de-9890-4243-9243-e1210a4c7ec4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rerb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-5glrnv"><div data-rid="15e3fc8c-c7df-4dd5-9614-cdd5cacfe8db" class="r-u6qqf9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Will the seeds hurt?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2191d43e-7a04-4c74-91a8-4e08b627deab" class="r-1v6ubkg" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1uknkmo" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rerb2:"><div data-rid="a97b3e86-8129-43f3-9635-92d9d85cfbf2" class="r-kt5zyp"><div data-rid="32590d6d-c08d-4fd1-af7f-8c17431098d2" class="r-7jisku alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No. The seeds apply gentle pressure without needles or pain. Some people may feel mild tenderness when pressing them, which is normal and part of the calming effect.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="faa92958-84ba-4c60-ae6e-8d209aa926be" class="r-1d7j75q" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="5a625542-3cba-4045-8933-6f2e1faf427d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rirb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1qo1v6n"><div data-rid="cb471b7b-d800-4907-85d0-8b13c4713f17" class="r-1xak8oi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can everyone use ear seeds?</p></span></div><div data-rid="10f14f9e-34b9-4c4e-929c-e40696be00ad" class="r-1yfjii6" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-mgq0k7" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rirb2:"><div data-rid="0146a087-18f1-4201-8c7a-fea64c1707ae" class="r-34mlg5"><div data-rid="49a3b164-79ab-4dd0-9622-973a2e2c028d" class="r-h4deqo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ear seeds are not suitable during pregnancy or for those with an allergy to gold, nickel, silver, metal or adhesive.  For those with a nickel allergy, please use our nickel free, 100% titanium ear seeds. We also do not recommend children under 8 using our ear seeds, and we recommend that they are supervised. Please keep out of reach from small children.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3ee42109-5eac-4fd5-9d36-1448dfa58ab4" class="r-1bbuv9c" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="477aa82c-792d-47f2-a1a6-3eb3f4fcd3aa" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-19kbdvg"><div data-rid="d416007d-2223-4797-8d7c-9e61007f0d3c" class="r-14rjt8g alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I wear ear seeds while sleeping or showering?</p></span></div><div data-rid="abb5f270-d45d-4824-a1ad-c5592c4dddfe" class="r-xxgupb" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-y1uz6g" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rmrb2:"><div data-rid="aa647d90-5e26-410f-857d-53d4a31b351e" class="r-8wprsl"><div data-rid="e0fc6dc2-f3dc-4103-aa5a-7b536903263a" class="r-1cm2xjj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, ear seeds are designed to stay securely in place and can be worn while sleeping. It’s best to avoid soaking them directly in water, so showering with care is advised.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="16f614cb-a86d-4688-9dc2-2e62595cba7d" class="r-12dgs9z" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="292565c7-b69e-4024-81c6-90c0fc4c571f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rqrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1168g4b"><div data-rid="d00882b2-b3f4-4820-9d07-9d484123870b" class="r-16a0jqh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do ear seeds compare to acupuncture?</p></span></div><div data-rid="828739ff-9f56-4066-98ea-441c8ea8da